  "content": "<div class=\"newsxq\"> <div class=\"fhan\"> <div class=\"container\"> <p><a href=\"javascript:;\" onclick=\"javascript:history.back(-1);return false;\">返回<img src=\"../../../../static/home/images/tu14.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_nr\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"xqnr\"> <div class=\"xq_l\"> <div class=\"xq_rq\"><span>18</span><font>2024.10</font></div> <div class=\"xq_l_l\"> <h2>斩获殊荣！GreatSQL亮相2024 OSCAR开源产业大会 彰显开源实力</h2> <b>2024.10.18</b> <p></p><p><section><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible;\">10月16日，由中国通信标准化协会主办，中国信息通信研究院承办的开源领域年度盛会——2024 OSCAR开源产业大会在北京召开。大会上，GreatSQL社区以卓越的开源贡献和创新能力，赢得了业界的高度认可，一举斩获“尖峰开源人物”荣誉奖项，并受邀在开源项目及商业化论坛发表主题演讲，于大会交流展示区和开源市集同步亮相，展示社区最新开源技术成果与应用实践，这不仅是对GreatSQL过去努力的肯定，更是对未来持续发展的激励与鞭策。</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible;\"><br/></p></section></p><p></p><p></p><p><section><section><section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://pic.rmb.bdstatic.com/bjh/241018/dump/e315f978c5d25ce8aafbd77f373deddc.png?x-bce-process=image/watermark,bucket_baidu-rmb-video-cover-1,image_YmpoL25ld3MvNjUzZjZkMjRlMDJiNjdjZWU1NzEzODg0MDNhYTQ0YzQucG5n,type_RlpMYW5UaW5nSGVpU01HQg==,w_26,text_QOS4h-mHjOaVsOaNruW6kw==,size_26,x_20,y_20,interval_2,color_FFFFFF,effect_softoutline,shc_000000,blr_2,align_1\"/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://pic.rmb.bdstatic.com/bjh/241018/dump/148e856c7b87ac4120162d571e061637.jpeg?x-bce-process=image/watermark,bucket_baidu-rmb-video-cover-1,image_YmpoL25ld3MvNjUzZjZkMjRlMDJiNjdjZWU1NzEzODg0MDNhYTQ0YzQucG5n,type_RlpMYW5UaW5nSGVpU01HQg==,w_28,text_QOS4h-mHjOaVsOaNruW6kw==,size_28,x_22,y_22,interval_2,color_FFFFFF,effect_softoutline,shc_000000,blr_2,align_1\"/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></p><p></p><p></p><p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background: 0px 0px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; min-height: 1em;\"><br/></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background: 0px 0px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; min-height: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background: 0px 0px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box;\">2024 OSCAR开源产业大会</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></p><p></p><p></p><p><section><section><section><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; min-height: 1em;\">2024 OSCAR开源产业大会邀请工业和信息化部信息技术发展司软件产业处处长李琰，中国信息通信研究院党委副书记王晓丽，中国通信标准化协会副理事长兼秘书长代晓慧发表致辞。人民日报出版社副社长赵军、中国电力发展促进会副秘书长李国春以及产业界各企业代表出席会议。</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; min-height: 1em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; min-height: 1em;\">本次大会旨在搭建专业平台，广纳产研智慧，扎实开源体系构建，繁荣开源生态建设，推动开源产业发展。会上进行了《开源体系建设 100 问》预发布，同时举办了电力企业开源技术典型实践案例联合征集活动，以及金融行业开源社区新成员授牌仪式。大会针对数字公共产品洞察和开源体系建设路径模式进行了深入解读，公布了 2024 年可信开源最新评估结果与 OSCAR开源尖峰案例，并更新了中国信息通信研究院云大所在开源领域的最新工作进展与多项报告成果。</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; min-height: 1em;\"><br/></p></section></section></section></p><p></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; min-height: 1em; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background: 0px 0px rgb(210, 32, 26); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(234, 220, 212); text-align: justify;\">“OSCAR开源尖峰人物”荣誉加冕</span></p><p></p><p><section><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; min-height: 1em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">“OSCAR 开源尖峰案例”评选作为每年OSCAR开源产业大会的重要环节，旨在树立开源典范，更好地推动开源技术在中国市场的落地。本次评选共分为</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box;\">“开源人物”、“开源社区及开源项目”、“开源风险治理”</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">和</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box;\">“开源商业化”</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">四个领域的案例征集评选。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; min-height: 1em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; min-height: 1em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">GreatSQL一直致力于推动开源技术的创新、传播与应用，通过不断完善开源项目、拓展生态合作、提升用户体验，为开源产业的发展注入了新的活力，</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(210, 32, 26);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box;\">开源社区运营负责人叶金荣成功入选“尖峰开源人物”荣誉称号</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; min-height: 1em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></span></p></